`AlgebraSha256d.lean` — the composition-level algebra statement for SHA-256d, and the
iteration verdict on the round-level algebraic obstruction.

Task AR-14 of the algebra-rooting wave. Owned file: this one, plus `AlgebraSha256d.md`. No
