WHAT IS AND IS NOT CLAIMED

The statement in section 1 is a theorem *about the canonical object* `Apeiron.Crypto.Sha2.hash`,
over the canonical types `List (BitVec 8) -> Vector (BitVec 32) 8`. It is pure `Nat`/`List`
algebra and is kernel-checked. It is **not** a refinement of the extracted
